B2. Rozgałęzienie w pętli For each attachment
Kliknij + nad File name, na samej górze wnętrza pętli, i wybierz Condition. Nazwa: Is_embedded_mail.
Lewa strona (fx): empty(items('For_each_attachment')?['contentBytes'])
Operator: is equal to
Prawa strona (fx): true
Przeciągnij File name i Save file do gałęzi False.
W gałęzi True dodaj po kolei trzy akcje:
a) Send an HTTP request (z sekcji Office 365 Outlook), nazwa Get_embedded_mail
Method: GET
URI (fx):
concat('https://graph.microsoft.com/v1.0/users/', outputs('Config')?['Mailbox'], '/messages/', items('For_each_email')?['id'], '/attachments/', items('For_each_attachment')?['id'], '/$value')
b) Compose, nazwa Embedded_file_name (fx):
concat(take(replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(coalesce(items('For_each_attachment')?['name'], 'mail'), '"', ''), '*', ''), ':', ''), '<', ''), '>', ''), '?', ''), '/', ''), '\', ''), '|', ''), 100), '_', formatDateTime(outputs('Local_received'), 'yyyyMMdd-HHmmss'), '.eml')
c) Create file (SharePoint), nazwa Save_embedded_mail
Site Address: BSO FA
Folder Path (fx): outputs('Target_path')
File Name (fx): outputs('Embedded_file_name')
File Content (fx): body('Get_embedded_mail')
Wnętrze pętli powinno teraz wyglądać tak:
For each attachment
 └ Is embedded mail
     ├ True:  Get embedded mail → Embedded file name → Save embedded mail
     └ False: File name → Save file
B3. Kliknij Save.
